      "updated": 1791633045247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Revoke or rotate the API key immediately. Don't wait until you clean up GitHub.\n2. Remove the key from the code and replace it with an environment variable.\n3. Check GitHub's history and logs to understand where the key was exposed.\n4. If needed, clean the Git history to remove the secret, and coordinate with teammates before rewriting shared history.\n5. Check for unauthorized use of the key and any unexpected charges or activity.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Revoke or rotate the API key immediately. Don't wait until you clean up GitHub.\n2. Remove the key from the code and replace it with an environment variable.\n3. Check GitHub's history and logs to understand where the key was exposed.\n4. If needed, clean the Git history to remove the secret, and coordinate with teammates before rewriting shared history.\n5. Check for unauthorized use of the key and any unexpected charges or activity.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
