      "text": "I've updated the login validation based on your feedback. I also changed the API error-\nhandling logic so failed requests display a clear error message. I've tested both cases\nlocally and pushed the updates to the same branch. Could you please review the updated\nimplementation?",
      "fontSize": 20,
