      "updated": 1791638043596,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reflog ko ek purani locations ki diary samajh.\n\nJaise tere phone mein location history ho, jisse pata chale ki tu pehle kahan gayi thi,\n waise hi reflog batata hai ki Git ka HEAD pehle kin commits par tha.",
